    "# Exp 18 — CLIP MLP: Octopus Presence Classifier\n",
    "\n",
    "Binary classification: **visible** (octopus present) vs **hidden** (not visible).  \n",
    "Frozen CLIP ViT-B/32 features → MLP head (512 → 256 → 64 → 2) with dropout.  \n",
    "Replaces the single linear layer from exp17."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
